Rebuilt onto the current codebase. Admin -> Locations gains a 'Sales by store —
self-order vs counter' card: completed Square orders over a window (today / 7 /
14 / 30 days), per store, split into App (customers self-ordering), Counter
(POS), and Other, with a daily breakdown. Authoritative from Square.

server: /api/admin/analytics/sales?days=N searches completed orders per active
location (paginated), buckets by day in the store timezone, and classifies each
by order source. Client renders per-store totals + a daily details view.

Verified: source classification (App/POS/Other); the sales card loads and renders
per-store App/Counter rows — no page errors; build + server check pass.
